    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56450" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κελάδω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		 form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κελαδέω</span>, used in
			part. only, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sounding</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πὰρ ποταμὸν κελάδοντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					18.576
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				B.
				8.65
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Posidipp.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Tz.
				<u>H.</u>
				7.661
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλῆτο ῥόος κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					21.16
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				17.92
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζέφυρον κελάδοντ᾽ ἐπὶ οἴνοπα πόντον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					2.421
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόντον κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					284
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βορέης κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					8.243
				</span></i>
			.</div>
